@startuml
title State diagram of Safehome Security Function operations

[*] --> PowerOn

state "Power On" as PowerOn
state "Startup Check" as StartupCheck
state "Ready to Use" as ReadyToUse
state "Reset" as Reset
state "Activated" as Activated
state "Monitoring" as Monitoring
state "Alarm Activated" as AlarmActivated
state "False Alarm" as FalseAlarm
state "Time Ended" as TimeEnded
state "Normal" as Normal

PowerOn --> StartupCheck : Power On
StartupCheck --> ReadyToUse : StartupCheckComplete
ReadyToUse --> Reset : ResetRequested
ReadyToUse --> Activated : ActivateRequested
ReadyToUse --> Normal : TurnOffRequested
Activated --> Monitoring : Activated
Monitoring --> AlarmActivated : SensorTriggered
AlarmActivated --> FalseAlarm or TimeEnded
FalseAlarm --> Monitoring : FalseAlarmDetected
TimeEnded --> Monitoring : TimeEnded
Normal --> Normal : PasswordEntered

@enduml
